\n          \"item\": \"https://www.motiontheagency.com/services/branded-motion\",\n          \"name\": \"Branded Motion\",\n          \"position\": 3\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n  \n<!--  [Attributes by Finsweet] CMS Slider  -->\n<script async=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@finsweet/attributes-cmsslider@1/cmsslider.js\"></script>\n<!--  Slick Slider CSS  -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/slick-carousel@1.8.1/slick/slick.css\">\n<style>\n/*Slick Slider Customizations*/\n.slick-list {\n\t\tdisplay: flex;\n    overflow: visible;\n    width: 100%;\n}\n.slick-track {\n\t\tdisplay: flex;\n}\n</style>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Product\",\n      \"name\": \"Branded Motion Graphics Services\",\n      \"url\": \"https://motiontheagency.com/services/motion-design/\",\n      \"description\": \"Make your videos stand out with branded motion graphics. Boost engagement and drive loyalty. Packages start at £1495. Get your free sample!\",\n      \"brand\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n        \"name\": \"Motion The Agency\"\n      },\n      \"review\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Review\",\n        \"reviewRating\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Rating\",\n          \"ratingValue\": \"5\",\n          \"bestRating\": \"5\"\n        },\n        \"author\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n          \"name\": \"Clutch\",\n          \"url\": \"https://clutch.co/profile/motion-agency-0\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What are motion design services and how can they benefit my marketing campaigns?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Motion design services involve the use of 2D and 3D animation to create visually engaging and dynamic content. Branded motion graphics, in particular, can help to reinforce your brand identity and convey key messages to your target audience in a way that is both memorable and effective. By leveraging the power of branded motion graphics, you can enhance your marketing campaigns in a number of ways.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How can branded motion graphics help my business stand out from competitors?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Branded motion graphics can give your business a competitive edge by making your brand message more visually compelling and memorable. Using our Motion Graphics Agency to create branded motion graphics can help you communicate your brand story, values, and key messages in a way that stands out from your competitors.\\n\\nBy incorporating branded motion graphics into your marketing campaigns, you can create a unique visual identity that resonates with your target audience and sets you apart from the competition. Branded motion graphics can also help you establish a consistent brand image across different platforms and channels, making it easier for your audience to recognize and engage with your brand.\\n\\nMoreover, branded motion graphics can add a level of sophistication and professionalism to your marketing efforts, which can further enhance your credibility and reputation in the industry. As a result, using creative video services as part of your marketing strategy can help you attract more customers, increase engagement and conversions, and ultimately, grow your business.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Can motion design services help me increase customer engagement and conversions?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Branded motion graphics and motion design services can indeed help increase customer engagement and conversions for your business. Motion design refers to the use of animation, typography, and graphics to create visually appealing content that can convey a message or story in a dynamic way.\\n\\nBy incorporating branded motion graphics into your marketing strategy, you can create eye-catching visuals that capture the attention of your target audience and communicate your brand message effectively. Branded motion graphics can help you stand out from competitors and make your brand more memorable to potential customers.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How can I integrate branded motion graphics into my overall marketing strategy to achieve my business goals?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Integrating branded motion graphics into your overall marketing strategy can help you achieve your business goals by increasing engagement, brand awareness, and conversions. First, it’s important to identify the specific areas in your marketing strategy where branded motion graphics can add value, such as explainer videos, social media posts, or website animations.\\n\\nWorking with a Motion Graphics Agency like ours can help ensure that your animated product videos and the way you visually express your services align with your brand identity and messaging. Your provider can create custom-designed motion graphics that are tailored to your brand, and can also help you optimize your graphics for different platforms and channels.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What tools do professional motion graphics agencies use?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Professional Motion Graphics Agencies use a variety of software and tools to create high-quality motion graphics for social media channels. Some of the most popular software used by professionals in this field include Adobe After Effects, Cinema 4D, and Blender. These tools allow for the creation of stunning visual effects, 3D animations, and dynamic motion graphics that can capture the attention of your target audience. Learn more with our services 2D Animators For Hire and 3D Animators For Hire.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"VideoObject\",\n  \"name\": \"Branded Motion Showreel — Motion The Agency\",\n  \"description\": \"Motion The Agency's branded motion graphics showreel for B2B SaaS and tech brands.\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"../videos/Branded-Motion-poster-00001.jpg\",\n  \"uploadDate\": \"2024-10-29T17:07:03+00:00\",\n  \"duration\": \"PT8S\",\n  \"contentUrl\": \"../videos/Branded-Motion-transcode.mp4\",\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"Motion The Agency\",\n    \"logo\": {\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n      \"url\": \"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66ebfb6ec8f20d5eda50eb34/6762c1dea24d4f98491f457f_Logo.png\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Branded Motion Graphics Services for Video Marketing Success\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Make your videos stand out with branded motion graphics. Boost engagement and drive loyalty. Packages start at $3,480. Get your free sample!\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66ebfb6ec8f20d5eda50eb34/670cc171a0c8c36348181481_UI%20Animation%20Thumbnail.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">",
    "bodyEnd": "\n<!--  Slick Slider JS  -->\n  <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/slick-carousel@1.8.1/slick/slick.min.js\"></script>\n  <!--  Card Slider Config  -->\n  <script>\n    $(document).ready(function() {\n        //-------- Filter functionality ----------\n        // Add class name of category slug to each slider item\n        $('.card-slider_item').addClass(function() {\n            return $(this).find('.card-category_slug').text() //class of element hidden in slider collection with category slug\n        });\n        // When you click a dropdown link, filter the slider\n        $(\".dropdown-link\").click(function() {\n            if ($(this).hasClass(\"cc-selected\")) { //if the dropdown link is already selected, unselect and unfilter the slider\n                $(\"#cms-slider\").slick('slickUnfilter');\n                $(this).removeClass(\"cc-selected\");\n            } else { //if the dropdown link isn't selected, add selected class and filter the slider\n                $(\".dropdown-link\").removeClass(\"cc-selected\");\n                $(this).addClass(\"cc-selected\");\n                var filter = $(this).find('.dropdown-link_slug').text(); //class of element hidden in dropdown link with category slug\n                var filterClass = '.' + filter; //add '.' before slug name to associate it as a class\n                $(\"#cms-slider\").slick('slickUnfilter'); //clear previous filter on slider\n                $(\"#cms-slider\").slick('slickFilter', filterClass); //filter the slider by the selected dropdown link's slug\n            }\n        });\n        //-------- Configure slider ----------\n        $('#cms-slider').slick({\n            arrows: false,\n            infinite: false,\n            autoplay: false,\n            autoplaySpeed: 8000,\n            speed: 300,\n            slidesToShow: 3,\n            slidesToScroll: 1,\n            responsive: [{\n                    breakpoint: 1024,\n                    settings: {\n                        slidesToShow: 2\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    breakpoint: 768,\n                    settings: {\n                        slidesToShow: 1\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        });\n        //--------- Set custom nav ---------\n        $('#cms-slider-right').click(function() {\n            $('#cms-slider').slick('slickNext');\n        });\n        $('#cms-slider-left').click(function() {\n            $('#cms-slider').slick('slickPrev');\n        });\n    });\n</script>\n  ",
    "bodyStart": "<script>document.body.className=\"body\";</script>"
  }
};
